  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.30 - Add AM021 immutable and frozen collection fixes\n\n            Changed:\n            - Added AM021 simple-conversion fixes for ImmutableList<T>, ImmutableHashSet<T>, and FrozenSet<T> destination collections\n            - Kept custom immutable-lookalike destination collections on the manual-review ignore path instead of using name-based rewrites\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 with targeted AM021 code-fix coverage\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Codex review passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.29 - Harden AM003 custom collection fixer safety",
